{
  "title": "Insurance Single Pane of Glass",
  "description": "PoC insurance-business-observability | SPG principal para quatro golden signals: traffic, latency, errors, saturation. Jornada ms-propostas -> Outbox -> Kafka -> ms-cadastro. Apenas métricas recebidas, médias explicitadas, sem SLO aprovado ou zero artificial. [Application Health](https://us5.datadoghq.com/dashboard/iua-v7j-i8a) | [Business Overview](https://us5.datadoghq.com/dashboard/63s-vgf-ghp) | [Journey Health](https://us5.datadoghq.com/dashboard/r6i-rea-k8h)",
  "layout_type": "ordered",
  "reflow_type": "fixed",
  "template_variables": [
    {
      "name": "env",
      "prefix": "env",
      "available_values": [
        "local"
      ],
      "defaults": [
        "local"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "service",
      "prefix": "service",
      "available_values": [
        "ms-propostas",
        "ms-cadastro"
      ],
      "defaults": [
        "*"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "widgets": [
    {
      "definition": {
        "type": "note",
        "content": "**Insurance Business Observability — Single Pane of Glass**\n\nEntrada única para a jornada ms-propostas → Outbox → Kafka → ms-cadastro. Quatro sinais de ouro + negócio + investigação. Filtros env/service se aplicam às métricas. [Application Health](https://us5.datadoghq.com/dashboard/iua-v7j-i8a) | [Business Overview](https://us5.datadoghq.com/dashboard/63s-vgf-ghp) | [Journey Health](https://us5.datadoghq.com/dashboard/r6i-rea-k8h)",
        "background_color": "white",
        "font_size": "14",
        "has_padding": true
      },
      "layout": {
        "width": 12,
        "height": 3,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "definition": {
        "type": "query_value",
        "title": "TRÁFEGO — execuções registro/Inbox por segundo",
        "requests": [
          {
            "q": "count:insurance.business.step.duration{project:insurance-business-observability,$env,$service}.as_rate()",
            "aggregator": "avg"
          }
        ],
        "autoscale": true,
        "precision": 2,
        "custom_unit": "operation / second"
      },
      "layout": {
        "width": 3,
        "height": 3,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 3
      }
    },
    {
      "definition": {
        "type": "query_value",
        "title": "LATÊNCIA — POST /proposals 2xx, média ms",
        "requests": [
          {
            "q": "avg:http.server.requests{project:insurance-business-observability,$env,$service,uri:/proposals,method:post,status:2*}",
            "aggregator": "avg"
          }
        ],
        "autoscale": true,
        "precision": 2,
        "custom_unit": "millisecond"
      },
      "layout": {
        "width": 3,
        "height": 3,
        "x": 3,
        "y": 3
      }
    },
    {
      "definition": {
        "type": "query_value",
        "title": "ERROS — falhas técnicas registro/Inbox",
        "requests": [
          {
            "q": "count:insurance.business.step.duration{project:insurance-business-observability,$env,$service,outcome:technical_failure}.as_count()",
            "aggregator": "sum"
          }
        ],
        "autoscale": true,
        "precision": 0
      },
      "layout": {
        "width": 3,
        "height": 3,
        "x": 6,
        "y": 3
      }
    },
    {
      "definition": {
        "type": "query_value",
        "title": "SATURAÇÃO — conexões JDBC ocupadas (%)",
        "requests": [
          {
            "queries": [
              {
                "data_source": "metrics",
                "name": "active",
                "query": "sum:hikaricp.connections.active{project:insurance-business-observability,$env,$service}",
                "aggregator": "avg"
              },
              {
                "data_source": "metrics",
                "name": "capacity",
                "query": "sum:hikaricp.connections.max{project:insurance-business-observability,$env,$service}",
                "aggregator": "avg"
              }
            ],
            "formulas": [
              {
                "formula": "100 * active / capacity"
              }
            ],
            "response_format": "scalar"
          }
        ],
        "autoscale": true,
        "precision": 2,
        "custom_unit": "percent"
      },
      "layout": {
        "width": 3,
        "height": 3,
        "x": 9,
        "y": 3
      }
    },
    {
      "definition": {
        "type": "note",
        "content": "**Os quatro sinais de ouro**\n\nTráfego mede trabalho técnico, incluindo replay/reentrega; não é quantidade de propostas. Latência é média, separando sucesso/falha nos gráficos; p95/p99 seguem pendentes. Erros HTTP/etapa sem ocorrências podem mostrar No Data. Saturação usa recursos existentes; sem SLO/limiar aprovado.",
        "background_color": "white",
        "font_size": "14",
        "has_padding": true
      },
      "layout": {
        "width": 12,
        "height": 2,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 6
      }
    },
    {
      "definition": {
        "type": "timeseries",
        "title": "1. Tráfego — HTTP POST /proposals (req/s)",
        "requests": [
          {
            "q": "count:http.server.requests{project:insurance-business-observability,$env,$service,uri:/proposals,method:post} by {service}.as_rate()",
            "display_type": "line"
          }
        ],
        "show_legend": true
      },
      "layout": {
        "width": 6,
        "height": 3,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "definition": {
        "type": "timeseries",
        "title": "1. Tráfego — execuções registro/Inbox (ops/s)",
        "requests": [
          {
            "q": "count:insurance.business.step.duration{project:insurance-business-observability,$env,$service} by {service,step}.as_rate()",
            "display_type": "line"
          }
        ],
        "show_legend": true
      },
      "layout": {
        "width": 6,
        "height": 3,
        "x": 6,
        "y": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "definition": {
        "type": "timeseries",
        "title": "2. Latência HTTP — sucesso 2xx e falha 5xx, médias ms",
        "requests": [
          {
            "q": "avg:http.server.requests{project:insurance-business-observability,$env,$service,uri:/proposals,method:post,status:2*} by {service,status}",
            "display_type": "line"
          },
          {
            "q": "avg:http.server.requests{project:insurance-business-observability,$env,$service,uri:/proposals,method:post,status:5*} by {service,status}",
            "display_type": "line"
          }
        ],
        "show_legend": true
      },
      "layout": {
        "width": 6,
        "height": 3,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 11
      }
    },
    {
      "definition": {
        "type": "timeseries",
        "title": "2. Latência — registro, Outbox e Inbox por resultado, médias ms",
        "requests": [
          {
            "q": "avg:insurance.business.step.duration{project:insurance-business-observability,$env,$service} by {service,step,outcome}",
            "display_type": "line"
          },
          {
            "q": "avg:insurance.outbox.publish.duration{project:insurance-business-observability,$env,$service} by {service,step,outcome}",
            "display_type": "line"
          }
        ],
        "show_legend": true
      },
      "layout": {
        "width": 6,
        "height": 3,
        "x": 6,
        "y": 11
      }
    },
    {
      "definition": {
        "type": "timeseries",
        "title": "3. Erros HTTP — 5xx / respostas POST (%)",
        "requests": [
          {
            "queries": [
              {
                "data_source": "metrics",
                "name": "failed",
                "query": "count:http.server.requests{project:insurance-business-observability,$env,$service,uri:/proposals,method:post,status:5*} by {service}.as_count()"
              },
              {
                "data_source": "metrics",
                "name": "total",
                "query": "count:http.server.requests{project:insurance-business-observability,$env,$service,uri:/proposals,method:post} by {service}.as_count()"
              }
            ],
            "formulas": [
              {
                "formula": "100 * failed / total"
              }
            ],
            "response_format": "timeseries",
            "display_type": "line"
          }
        ],
        "show_legend": true
      },
      "layout": {
        "width": 6,
        "height": 3,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 14
      }
    },
    {
      "definition": {
        "type": "timeseries",
        "title": "3. Erros técnicos — registro, Inbox e Outbox por causa",
        "requests": [
          {
            "q": "count:insurance.business.step.duration{project:insurance-business-observability,$env,$service,outcome:technical_failure} by {service,step,error_code}.as_count()",
            "display_type": "line"
          },
          {
            "q": "count:insurance.outbox.publish.duration{project:insurance-business-observability,$env,$service,outcome:retry} by {service,step,error_code}.as_count()",
            "display_type": "line"
          }
        ],
        "show_legend": true
      },
      "layout": {
        "width": 6,
        "height": 3,
        "x": 6,
        "y": 14
      }
    },
    {
      "definition": {
        "type": "timeseries",
        "title": "4. Saturação — Hikari active / max por serviço (%)",
        "requests": [
          {
            "queries": [
              {
                "data_source": "metrics",
                "name": "active",
                "query": "sum:hikaricp.connections.active{project:insurance-business-observability,$env,$service} by {service}"
              },
              {
                "data_source": "metrics",
                "name": "capacity",
                "query": "sum:hikaricp.connections.max{project:insurance-business-observability,$env,$service} by {service}"
              }
            ],
            "formulas": [
              {
                "formula": "100 * active / capacity"
              }
            ],
            "response_format": "timeseries",
            "display_type": "line"
          }
        ],
        "show_legend": true
      },
      "layout": {
        "width": 6,
        "height": 3,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 17
      }
    },
    {
      "definition": {
        "type": "timeseries",
        "title": "4. Saturação — espera por conexão JDBC",
        "requests": [
          {
            "q": "sum:hikaricp.connections.pending{project:insurance-business-observability,$env,$service} by {service}",
            "display_type": "line"
          }
        ],
        "show_legend": true
      },
      "layout": {
        "width": 6,
        "height": 3,
        "x": 6,
        "y": 17
      }
    },
    {
      "definition": {
        "type": "timeseries",
        "title": "4. Saturação — CPU do processo (%)",
        "requests": [
          {
            "queries": [
              {
                "data_source": "metrics",
                "name": "cpu",
                "query": "avg:process.cpu.usage{project:insurance-business-observability,$env,$service} by {service}"
              }
            ],
            "formulas": [
              {
                "formula": "100 * cpu"
              }
            ],
            "response_format": "timeseries",
            "display_type": "line"
          }
        ],
        "show_legend": true
      },
      "layout": {
        "width": 6,
        "height": 3,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 20
      }
    },
    {
      "definition": {
        "type": "timeseries",
        "title": "4. Saturação — heap usado e comprometido (bytes)",
        "requests": [
          {
            "q": "sum:jvm.memory.used{project:insurance-business-observability,$env,$service,area:heap} by {service}",
            "display_type": "line"
          },
          {
            "q": "sum:jvm.memory.committed{project:insurance-business-observability,$env,$service,area:heap} by {service}",
            "display_type": "line"
          }
        ],
        "show_legend": true
      },
      "layout": {
        "width": 6,
        "height": 3,
        "x": 6,
        "y": 20
      }
    },
    {
      "definition": {
        "type": "note",
        "content": "**Negócio e entrega confiável**\n\nProposta nova e recebimento no cadastro são marcos da mesma jornada; não some os dois como propostas adicionais. Backlog/idade são snapshots do banco: usar máximo entre réplicas e conferir snapshot.available. Heap comprometido não é limite Xmx; CPU é sinal de uso, não prova isolada de saturação.",
        "background_color": "white",
        "font_size": "14",
        "has_padding": true
      },
      "layout": {
        "width": 12,
        "height": 2,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 23
      }
    },
    {
      "definition": {
        "type": "query_value",
        "title": "Propostas novas registradas",
        "requests": [
          {
            "q": "sum:insurance.business.transitions{project:insurance-business-observability,$env,$service,step:proposal_register}.as_count()",
            "aggregator": "sum"
          }
        ],
        "autoscale": true,
        "precision": 0
      },
      "layout": {
        "width": 3,
        "height": 3,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 25
      }
    },
    {
      "definition": {
        "type": "query_value",
        "title": "Propostas novas processadas no cadastro",
        "requests": [
          {
            "q": "sum:insurance.business.transitions{project:insurance-business-observability,$env,$service,step:proposal_receive}.as_count()",
            "aggregator": "sum"
          }
        ],
        "autoscale": true,
        "precision": 0
      },
      "layout": {
        "width": 3,
        "height": 3,
        "x": 3,
        "y": 25
      }
    },
    {
      "definition": {
        "type": "query_value",
        "title": "Outbox — pendentes atuais",
        "requests": [
          {
            "q": "max:insurance.outbox.pending{project:insurance-business-observability,$env,$service}",
            "aggregator": "last"
          }
        ],
        "autoscale": true,
        "precision": 0
      },
      "layout": {
        "width": 3,
        "height": 3,
        "x": 6,
        "y": 25
      }
    },
    {
      "definition": {
        "type": "query_value",
        "title": "Outbox — maior idade pendente (s)",
        "requests": [
          {
            "q": "max:insurance.outbox.oldest.age{project:insurance-business-observability,$env,$service}",
            "aggregator": "last"
          }
        ],
        "autoscale": true,
        "precision": 2,
        "custom_unit": "second"
      },
      "layout": {
        "width": 3,
        "height": 3,
        "x": 9,
        "y": 25
      }
    },
    {
      "definition": {
        "type": "timeseries",
        "title": "Entrega — tentativas, retries e duplicatas técnicas",
        "requests": [
          {
            "q": "sum:insurance.outbox.publish.attempts{project:insurance-business-observability,$env,$service}.as_count()",
            "display_type": "line"
          },
          {
            "q": "sum:insurance.outbox.dispatches{project:insurance-business-observability,$env,$service,outcome:retry}.as_count()",
            "display_type": "line"
          },
          {
            "q": "sum:insurance.inbox.duplicates{project:insurance-business-observability,$env,$service}.as_count()",
            "display_type": "line"
          }
        ],
        "show_legend": true
      },
      "layout": {
        "width": 6,
        "height": 3,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 28
      }
    },
    {
      "definition": {
        "type": "timeseries",
        "title": "Snapshot Outbox válido (1) / inválido (0)",
        "requests": [
          {
            "q": "min:insurance.outbox.snapshot.available{project:insurance-business-observability,$env,$service}",
            "display_type": "line"
          }
        ],
        "show_legend": true
      },
      "layout": {
        "width": 6,
        "height": 3,
        "x": 6,
        "y": 28
      }
    },
    {
      "definition": {
        "type": "note",
        "content": "**Investigar e agir**\n\n[Logs Explorer](https://us5.datadoghq.com/logs?query=project%3Ainsurance-business-observability%20env%3Alocal%20service%3A%28ms-propostas%20OR%20ms-cadastro%29) | [APM](https://us5.datadoghq.com/apm/traces?query=env%3Alocal%20service%3A%28ms-propostas%20OR%20ms-cadastro%29) | [Monitores](https://us5.datadoghq.com/monitors/manage)\n\nBuscar proposalId em @business_id nos logs e @businessId nos spans; usar trace_id reservado após a pipeline. Os dez monitores permanecem Draft/P5: não é prova de alertas ativos. Não há incidente automático.\n\nSem série de erro/denominador, o gráfico de taxa mostra No Data; não foi preenchido com zero. Com filtro service=ms-cadastro, os gráficos HTTP /proposals ficam sem dados porque sua entrada de negócio é Kafka. Métricas são best effort, sem ledger/exactly-once. Nenhuma métrica nova, percentil pago ou SLO foi habilitado.",
        "background_color": "white",
        "font_size": "14",
        "has_padding": true
      },
      "layout": {
        "width": 12,
        "height": 4,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 31
      }
    }
  ]
}
